	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/health-public-safety-white-back.jpg" alt="Health, Public Safety" width="308" height="335" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Learn how to support physical and mental health at Lake Tahoe Community College to help people and communities thrive. Get the skills to work effectively in a team that saves lives during emergency situations. Get employed in counseling, emergency medicine, law enforcement, medical administration, or firefighting.</p>
